        "original_id": "0e84a06e-f249-5d9d-acaf-5f12b99eb657",
        "text": "This chunk is about:\n- People: Les Clark, Ub Iwerks, Walt Disney\n- Products: Mickey Mouse, Oswald the Lucky Rabbit, Plane Crazy\n- Roles: animator, cartoonist, character designer, inventor, special effects technician, director\n\nFacts:\n- In 1927, Les Clark joined Disney.\n- Les Clark was the only person besides Ub Iwerks to work on the origins of Mickey Mouse.\n- Ub Iwerks was an American animator, cartoonist, character designer, inventor, and special effects technician.\n- Ub Iwerks created Oswald the Lucky Rabbit and Mickey Mouse with Walt Disney.\n- Plane Crazy is an American animated short film.\n- Walt Disney and Ub Iwerks directed Plane Crazy.",
        "type": "TextSummary"
      },
      {
